{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-08_beg",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-08",
  "title": "狩猟",
  "storyCode": "0-8",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7b72c4fcf0713a120c1fa4a4cc758d7426dd618902bdb8924bb15420b74bb824",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "……奴らの処遇を任せろ、だと……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "どういうつもりだ、メフィスト。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "僕がどういうつもりでも、君に断る理由なんてないと思うけど？　彼らは偶然紛れ込んできた虫けらでしかないんだし……わざわざ君が追いかけることもないでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ほらほら、情報はちゃ～んと僕の部下たちが受け取ったから、君の仕事はここまでだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "わかったら、持ち場に戻ってくれるかな？　君の担当は中枢区画のエネルギーエリアとその周辺って決まってるんだし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "チッ、余計な真似を……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "何より、君にはまだ仕事が残ってるはずだよねえ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "……もういい、好きにしろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "せいぜい惨めに負けるがいいさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "アハハ、言ってくれるねえ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "――行くぞ、お前たち。撤退だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "――了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……彼女のほうは、撤退するようですね。部隊の一部を率いて去っていきます……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……あの小僧、一体何のつもりだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "だが、なんにせよ……敵はまだ、我々の数倍はいる。全員、警戒を緩めるなよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "やあやあ。クラウンスレイヤーが失礼な態度を取ったようで、すまなかったね。彼女に代わってお詫びしよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……っと、いけない。先に自己紹介をしなくちゃね。僕のことは、メフィストと呼んでおくれよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……何が目的だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ああ、君たちに構う理由を聞きたいのかな？　だったら、組織としての答えは「特になし」だね。君らは今回のターゲットには含まれてないし、逃がしてあげてもいいくらいさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "であれば、どうして……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "それはもちろん――個人的に、君たちの戦い方に興味を持ったからだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ロドスの作戦と人員配置は、本当に面白いんだもの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……「面白い」、ですって？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "戦いを……殺し合いを、本気で面白がってるの……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "あっ、そうそう、君たちの資料には目を通させてもらったよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "初めは、てっきり普通の製薬会社だと思ってたんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "こうして見るに、君たちの仕事は、試験管と向き合うだけにはとどまらないみたいだよねえ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "となれば――ただ逃がすだけじゃ面白くないだろう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "どうだい、諸君。ここは一つ、僕とゲームをしてみないか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……断る。ままごとに付き合っている暇はないのでな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（小声）――構えておけ、アーミヤ。強行突破になりそうだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（小声）奴の注意は私が引いておく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（小声）は、はい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……信号弾？　おやおや、何の合図かな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "さてな。聞き分けのないガキに教鞭を執る趣味はないんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（小声）――アーミヤ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "やだなあ～、大の大人がそんな言い方するなんて。言葉遣いには気をつけましょうって習わなかったの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "貴様らのようなクズがこうも増えてこなければ、汚い言葉を学ぶ必要もなかったんだがな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（小声）……どうした、何があった？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（小声）撤退ルートが封じられました……！　あれは、彼の率いる部隊のようです……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "（小声）何……？　この数分のうちに、か……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "良くないなあ～。実に良くない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "僕は心から、精一杯のおもてなしをしようとしているのに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "お客様である君たちが、黙って逃げ出そうとするなんて――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "――そんなの、ひどい仕打ちじゃないか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "チッ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "アハハッ、そう身構えないでよ。ちゃんと逃がしてあげるからさ。……僕とのゲームに勝ったら、の話だけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ルールは簡単。僕の「友達」が、君らを八つ裂きにしようとするから――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "最後まで生き残りさえすれば、君たちの勝ちだ！　どうだい？　わかりやすくていいだろう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "――Ace！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "こっちの準備はできてる！　だが、無理やり突破するにしても――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "まずはこの包囲網のスキを見つけんことには、話にならんぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ッ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "すぐそこまで天災が迫っているのに……なぜこんなことをするんですか！　早くここから離れないと、全員――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "なぜって……そんなの決まってるじゃないか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "天災が迫る今こそが、命懸けのお楽しみにはぴったりだからさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……！　なんてことを……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……さてと。それじゃ始めようか、ゲストの皆さん。――君たちを僕のゲームにお招きすることができて、本当に光栄だよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "ゥア……ァア……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "こ、ろす……ッ！　お前、たち……殺して、やるッ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "っ、何か妙だ……！　気をつけろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "おっと、忘れるところだった。もう一つ、伝えておかないとね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "君たちが中枢区画でしていたこと……僕らにはお見通しだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "そこにいる、顔を隠した誰かさんを連れ出すために、あんな真似をしたんだろう？　……実に興味深いなあ～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ、何を……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "僕と違ってクラウンスレイヤーは、君たちがどこへ向かい、何をするのかということにしか、興味がなかったみたいだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "あくまで僕個人としては、別のことが気になっていてね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "それは何かと聞かれたら――この状況で、わざわざ連れ出されてきた人物……そう、君のことさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "見たところ、僕たちとはどこか少しだけ違うみたいだし……君は誰なんだ？　一体どこから来たんだい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "それに――そもそも、あの施設に生命維持装置があったなんて……どんな機械なのか気になってしまうなあ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "考えれば考えるほど、興味をそそられることばかりだよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "……そうだ、いいことを思いついた！　一つ提案なんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ここを通してあげる代わりに、その人を僕に渡してもらうっていうのはどうかな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "そうすれば、残りの人たちは見逃してあげるよ。ちょっともったいないけどね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ッ……！　ドクター！　私の後ろへ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――あなたのことは、私がお守りします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
